  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "春風微微"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><span><b>作者：</b></span></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>余純慧</b></span></p><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">熟sāi你hiah濟冬</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">甜甜ê好笑神　溫溫ê性情</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">親像春風　微微仔吹--過</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你講癌症揣著你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你真勇敢beh kap伊輸贏</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">開刀　做化療　一點仔to無問題</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">頭毛鉸--落-來　圓圓ê面</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你ê目睭真有神　你ê身軀iáu有埋血管</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你笑笑仔講無要緊</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你憂憂仔講　伊徙位--ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī骨頭hip著伊ê影跡</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Mā失志講　koh有一个罕見ê病症</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你ê面愈來愈圓</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">腹肚胸坎愈來愈大　人mā愈來愈矮</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你苦笑講ài攑拐仔--ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你沓沓仔準備未來</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你看好樹葬ê墓園　你為親人做上好ê拍算</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你mā留一跤揹仔hōo--我</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你講你bē行--ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你講你目睭看bē清楚</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你講你kiōng-beh bē-tàng喘khuì</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我tī急診室看著你</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">你ài掛sàng-sòo　你精神iáu真好</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我唸金剛經hōo你聽</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">有厝內親人ê陪伴　你安詳離開--去--ah</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">我知影你tsiok感恩　你有ê一切</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">只是阮lóng tsiok m̄甘--ê</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size: large;\">Tī春風微微ê時　beh送你遠行</span></p><div><br /></div><div><br /></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><a name='more'></a></span><div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></div><div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2-xo52rAetlF6tBYvCrhLBrvg36d9z94Eo-_KHWKLXnqbpd283Ny_0IeTxKmVqr0la90IRySA-wuBslHFqrhYMfqIpMxhT_pZFcl_wQSCSOFOn3JRjJ_N0HaLG7cc_H6Cd3J1nykEKk68cmpk-reWaEn9Nyd-g5gf6skc5h4nzdHVzkEZSWUX7BiAkw/s2847/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"2847\" data-original-width=\"2000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEi2-xo52rAetlF6tBYvCrhLBrvg36d9z94Eo-_KHWKLXnqbpd283Ny_0IeTxKmVqr0la90IRySA-wuBslHFqrhYMfqIpMxhT_pZFcl_wQSCSOFOn3JRjJ_N0HaLG7cc_H6Cd3J1nykEKk68cmpk-reWaEn9Nyd-g5gf6skc5h4nzdHVzkEZSWUX7BiAkw/w450-h640/339%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1_%E5%B0%81%E9%9D%A2.jpg\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEgontfUAggL0YZO-QPmqR2S4ioE4sChy7txs9-8uPftx2AVK4saCeSHp8JVH3Q1meA-Bl2_UYvRI3M_V1XrW1eRU5WZSk10FvQw0IrGHKU8mEspzRBQjmoH0vz-_tRqj_nOSovHJ2BbRNlAiDinu2TjgAAUghPRhvJCvGTCzsK8tTYkkk4vEUyZys5nOg/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%